# The Python tools that the wheel check of the mistral.rs pack needs, apart from the build tools. pack_mistralrs.sh installs
# this file with build-tools.constraints in one `pip install --require-hashes --force-reinstall -r` call.
# pefile reads the import tables of the Windows files in check_mistralrs_wheel.sh. It has no dependency and the build
# does not use it, so it changes no byte of the wheel. The ik and TEI packs do not run that check and do not install it.
